      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 14,
      "values:originalText": "Sch 2 (items 175–\n181): 17 Oct 2014\n(s  2(1) item 2)\n—\n\n(a)\nSubsection 2(1) (item 29) of the Statute Law Revision Act 2007 provides as\nfollows:\n\n(1) Each provision of this Act specified in column 1 of the table commences,\nor is taken to have commenced, in accordance with column 2 of the table.\nAny other statement in column 2 has effect according to its terms.\n\nCommencement information\nColumn 1\nColumn 2\nColumn 3\nProvision(s)\nCommencement\nDate/Details"
